      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046959">A</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046961">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046963">FMA</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046965">Multiply packed double precision floating-point values from xmm1 and xmm3/mem, subtract xmm2 and put result in xmm1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
